 settop:        , name,
C settop(top) - install a new top of the Pascal heap.
C In:  ACC := the new top address.  Its complement goes into [M1+30B], so
C      C/NW's own overflow test is what keeps malloc below that address.
                , ntr , 7
             1  , aex , 24b
             1  , atx , 30b
            13  , uj  ,
                , end ,
